OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to eliminate unacceptable
OL,4,Acorridor care'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust's new boss is determined
OL,7,Fto "minimise" the number of patients
OL,8,Fbeing treated in corridors this winter
OL,9,Fand wants to "eliminate" it completely.
OL,11,FCare Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,12,Finspectors visited Ipswich Hospital in
OL,13,FSeptember 2025 and found some patients
OL,14,Fhaving to wait up to 20 hours to be
OL,15,Ftreated or admitted to a ward.
OL,17,FIn January, the East Suffolk and North
OL,18,FEssex NHS Foundation Trust (ESNEFT),
OL,19,Fwhich runs the site, then declared a
OL,20,Fweek-long critical incident due to
OL,21,F"significant pressure".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
