OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to eliminate unacceptable
OL,4,Acorridor care'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Scott, who took over as ESNEFT's
OL,7,Fchief executive in August, has now
OL,8,Fspoken of his ambition to improve
OL,9,Femergency wait times and end corridor
OL,10,Fcare for good.
